{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈────啾唔！啊～好冷……」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1427", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……或許是我多事了，不過稍微……克制一下噴嚏比較好吧……」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我哪可能做到那種像女人一樣的事。」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1428", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早晨，好久沒有跟紗凪兩人在社團教室裡獨處了。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前明明常有這種情況的說。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近兩人的時間總是錯開。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「會冷的話，穿上外套比較好吧？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「穿外套不方便行動我不喜歡。」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1429", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是感冒的話就得不償失了。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「穿制服還要穿外套太麻煩了。」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1430", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼怕麻煩的人不會加入這個社團吧。」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1431", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，真正的理由是？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是不能對其他人說的事情吧？", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "該不會是像瀨名同學一樣注重服儀……之類的。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「絕對不准跟別人說喔！」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1432", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，當然了。」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1433", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪感覺很冷地雙手摩擦取暖，還呵了口氣。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看起來就覺得好可憐……", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其實我家附近的阿姨……」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1434", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，妳家附近的阿姨怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……她每天早上都會出來打掃家門口，也會跟我打招呼。」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1436", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她說小紗凪總是很有活力呢……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1437", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，然後？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋，都被阿姨那樣說了，就算冬天也得穿短袖短褲才行吧！」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1438", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蛤？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「阿姨很看好我啊。所以我在阿姨面前必須表現得很有活力才可以。」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1439", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果在冬天穿上外套的話……」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1440", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她就不會再說『小紗凪總是很有活力』了吧！」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1441", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呃。這我該怎麼回應她才好？", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道該說她是對阿姨莫名貼心，還是說腦袋接錯線……", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是，很有她的風格。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可惡，想笑的話就笑吧！所以我才不想說的嘛……」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1442", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～？」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "pn0386", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔……熊喵妳在啊，我好冷讓我抱一下～」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1443", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕嚕～！？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "pn0387", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊……妳毛茸茸的好溫暖喔……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1444", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕……」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "pn0388", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看著抱起熊喵用臉頰磨蹭的紗凪，突然覺得自己穿著外套有點不好意思。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇！？你幹嘛啦！？」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1445", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒幹嘛，看妳這麼冷想說把外套借妳。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只是想幫她披上外套而已，沒想到她反應這麼大。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「誰要穿你的外套啦！我有熊喵了，你自己穿！」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1446", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是妳感冒才剛好，不要讓身體著涼比較好喔。」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1447", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拿去穿吧，紗凪。」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不需要。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1448", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳還是一樣這麼愛逞強……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我又不是自己想要才逞強的。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1449", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪像在自言自語，表情顯得很落寞。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，她還是沒打算接下外套。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有女朋友的男人，隨便就對其他女人溫柔是不行的。」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1450", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你在跟美羽學姊交往吧？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1451", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳發現了嗎……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然了。」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1452", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我還以為一定會被紗凪罵，沒想到她這麼冷靜。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕……」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "pn0389", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我沒事的。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1453", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她對著懷裡的熊喵說，然後把牠輕輕放在桌上。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老實說，我以為妳會強硬反對。」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1454", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我加入社團的時候，紗凪就非常反對了……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算是現在，社團裡有你這樣的人我還是很不爽。」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1455", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那為什麼妳沒生氣？」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有生氣的理由。」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1456", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……？」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1457", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然很不甘心，但我認為你是配得上美羽學姊的男性……」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1458", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我遲遲沒有對大家說出跟美羽學姊的關係的理由。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是因為紗凪的存在太重要了。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我以為她一定不會認可我們的關係……", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且我認為美羽學姊一定最想得到紗凪的祝福。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感覺得到她們之間的羈絆，同時也羨慕她們兩人的關係。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳。」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該道謝的人是我。」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1459", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾教了我很多事。多虧了你，我覺得自己能成為『好女人』了。」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1460", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我覺得現在的紗凪就是好女人了。」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼，你懂我什麼？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1461", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛……我知道自己連紗凪的百分之一都不瞭解。」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，我知道妳是即使有氣喘，還是養了２隻貓的善良女孩。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1462", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要勉強自己喔。因為我小時候也有氣喘。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以我很明白那種痛苦。」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1463", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了。去拜託學園長，借一台沒有在用的暖爐來好了。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……加油喔。」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1464", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要讓美羽學姊幸福喔。」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1465", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪……」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我這樣並不是支持新吾的意思喔。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1466", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我只是希望美羽學姊幸福而已。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1467", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道。」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了……你買好要送美羽學姊的聖誕禮物了嗎？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1468", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽她這樣一問，我才發現自己完全忘了。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "對喔，聖誕節就快到了……", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……男人都這樣。你一定什麼都沒考慮吧？」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1469", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，現在開始考慮。」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拿你沒辦法～嗯，今年的休業式是２１日啊……」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1470", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，休業式結束後去買禮物吧！」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1471", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……去買禮物是一起去嗎？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我不相信你的品味。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1472", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟男朋友第一次度過的聖誕節，不可以讓美羽學姊失望吧！」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1473", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是不好吧，休業式後還讓妳陪我……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不是說了才不是為了你嗎？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1474", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「痛！？」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪一掌拍在我的肩膀上，然後露出惡作劇的笑容。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，染血聖誕節要拉開序幕了……」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sn1475", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不對。有哪裡不對……", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……欸？聖誕節？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1780", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。平安夜那天妳有空嗎？」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……抱歉喔。那天排打工了……」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1781", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那２５日怎麼樣？」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那天下午也要打工。」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1782", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊……」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本想趁早約她的，沒想到她的行程已經排好了。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好遺憾。好想跟美羽學姊一起過聖誕節啊……", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「平安夜那天，打工結束後可以嗎？雖然會拖到很晚……」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1783", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我沒問題，但學姊很辛苦吧？工作後還要見面……」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，我也沒問題。雖然時間很短，但還是想見面呢。」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1784", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊……」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，謝謝你來約我。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1785", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使到現在我也偶爾會想。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個人是我的女朋友這件事，該不會只是夢吧？", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是眼前學姊的笑容毫無疑問是真實的。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還摸得到溫暖的手。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，學姊。」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1786", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我最喜歡美羽學姊了。或許是喜歡到妳會覺得煩的喜歡。」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1787", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……只是突然想說喜歡而已。所以，抱歉。」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "說了相當支離破碎的的話。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "說喜歡又道歉也莫名其妙。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過……", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被你這樣一說，我也變得想說喜歡喜歡了啦～」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "mu1788", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能被這個人這樣說，我覺得自己是世界上最幸福的男人了。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
